>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LEGACY-OLD-REMAINDER.

DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OP PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-TEXT PIC X(8192) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-TEXT-LEN PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CMP PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CALL-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-PRIMARY-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CLEANUP-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-EMPTY-A.
   05 EA-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EA-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EA-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 EA-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-EMPTY-B.
   05 EB-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EB-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EB-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 EB-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-MODULUS.
   05 M-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 M-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 M-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 M-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-UNUSED-OUT.
   05 UO-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 UO-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 UO-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 UO-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-UNUSED-REM.
   05 UR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 UR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 UR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 UR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-X.
   05 LX-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LX-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LX-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LX-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-RESULT.
   05 LR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-X LK-RESULT LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    SET EA-HEAD EA-TAIL EB-HEAD EB-TAIL M-HEAD M-TAIL
        UO-HEAD UO-TAIL UR-HEAD UR-TAIL TO NULL
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-CALL-STATUS WS-PRIMARY-STATUS
    *> 输出仍归调用方所有；禁止覆盖已经持有堆链的值。
    IF LR-SIGN NOT = 0 OR LR-CHUNKS NOT = 0
       OR LR-HEAD NOT = NULL OR LR-TAIL NOT = NULL
        MOVE 175 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF

    *> DISCOVERY 01：故意保留旧的常规余数；不得在本阶段修复 0。
    MOVE "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" TO WS-TEXT
    MOVE 39 TO WS-TEXT-LEN
    MOVE "INIT-TEXT" TO WS-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN WS-EMPTY-A WS-EMPTY-B
        WS-MODULUS WS-UNUSED-REM WS-CMP WS-CALL-STATUS

    IF WS-CALL-STATUS = 0
        MOVE "MOD-EUCLID" TO WS-OP
        CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
            WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN LK-X WS-MODULUS
            LK-RESULT WS-UNUSED-REM WS-CMP WS-CALL-STATUS
    END-IF

    MOVE WS-CALL-STATUS TO WS-PRIMARY-STATUS
    MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CLEANUP-STATUS
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN WS-MODULUS WS-EMPTY-B
        WS-UNUSED-OUT WS-UNUSED-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEANUP-STATUS
    IF WS-PRIMARY-STATUS = 0
        MOVE WS-CLEANUP-STATUS TO WS-PRIMARY-STATUS
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-PRIMARY-STATUS TO LK-STATUS
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM LEGACY-OLD-REMAINDER.
